OL,3,GNEWSA'No timetable' yet for tower block
OL,4,Ademolition
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil chiefs have said there is "no
OL,7,Ftimetable for demolition" for a
OL,8,Fhigh-rise block of flats until its
OL,9,Fresidents have been rehomed.
OL,11,FSouth Tyneside Council said Hebburn's
OL,12,FDurham Court, which was built in 1974
OL,13,Fand is the town's last remaining
OL,14,Fresidential high-rise building, would
OL,15,Fnot be knocked down until all 96
OL,16,Fresidents found a suitable alternative
OL,17,Fhome.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
