OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'No timetable' yet for tower block
OL,4,Ademolition
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council agreed to demolish the
OL,7,F18-storey tower block, which houses
OL,8,Fpeople aged 55 and over, in June which
OL,9,Fwas recommended as the "most
OL,10,Feconomically advantageous option".
OL,12,FCouncillor Steve Smith, Reform UK
OL,13,Fcabinet member for housing, said "good
OL,14,Fprogress" had been made "with the
OL,15,Fmajority now rehoused and settling into
OL,16,Ftheir new homes".
